      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The study included 1418 patients with FC I-IV stable angina of effort (42.4% men and 57.6% women, mean age 74.6 +/- 1.2 years). The possibility to supplement standard therapy with myocardial cytoprotectors (trimetasidin, mexidol, qudesan) was estimated in 4 groups of patients from the severity of pain syndrome, chronic cardiac insufficiency, and heart rhythm disturbances."},
